{"type":"data","nodes":[{"type":"data","data":[{"latestDate":1},"2026-08-18"],"uses":{}},{"type":"data","data":[{"model":1,"htmlContent":7},{"name":2,"description":3,"url":4,"category":5,"subcategory":6},"Claude 3.5 Sonnet","First 3.5-generation model; outperformed Claude 3 Opus at lower cost. Retired 2025-10-28.","https://ai-tldr.dev/models/claude-3-5-sonnet/","Anthropic","Claude Sonnet","\u003Csection id=\"overview\" class=\"lrn-section\" aria-labelledby=\"overview-h\">\u003Ch2 class=\"lrn-h2\" id=\"overview-h\">\u003Cspan class=\"lrn-h2-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">//\u003C/span> Overview\u003C/h2>\u003Cp class=\"lrn-p\">The original Claude 3.5 Sonnet was released on June 20, 2024, and was a breakout model: it outperformed the much larger Claude 3 Opus on most benchmarks while keeping mid-tier pricing and faster speed. It set new marks for the time on graduate-level reasoning (GPQA), undergraduate knowledge (MMLU), and coding (HumanEval).\u003C/p>\u003Cp class=\"lrn-p\">On the well-documented benchmarks it scored 59.4% on GPQA Diamond, 88.7% on MMLU, 92.0% on HumanEval, and 68.3% on MMMU for vision. In Anthropic's internal agentic coding evaluation it solved 64% of problems, versus 38% for Claude 3 Opus. The launch also introduced Artifacts on claude.ai, a workspace for viewing and iterating on generated content.\u003C/p>\u003Cp class=\"lrn-p\">Claude 3.5 Sonnet has a 200K token context window, up to 8,192 output tokens, and supports text and vision input, at $3 / $15 per million tokens. Its model ID is claude-3-5-sonnet-20240620; the snapshot was retired on October 28, 2025, with Sonnet 4.6 as the recommended successor.\u003C/p>\u003Cdiv class=\"lrn-table-wrap\">\u003Ctable class=\"lrn-table\">\u003Ctbody>\u003Ctr>\u003Cth scope=\"row\">Released\u003C/th>\u003Ctd>2024-06-20\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Cth scope=\"row\">License\u003C/th>\u003Ctd>Proprietary\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Cth scope=\"row\">Weights\u003C/th>\u003Ctd>API only\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Cth scope=\"row\">Context\u003C/th>\u003Ctd>200K\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Cth scope=\"row\">Max output\u003C/th>\u003Ctd>8K\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Cth scope=\"row\">Architecture\u003C/th>\u003Ctd>Proprietary transformer (non-reasoning); Claude 3.5 generation.\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Cth scope=\"row\">Knowledge cutoff\u003C/th>\u003Ctd>April 2024\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Cth scope=\"row\">Modalities\u003C/th>\u003Ctd>Text, Vision, PDF\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Cth scope=\"row\">Status\u003C/th>\u003Ctd>Deprecated\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003C/tbody>\u003C/table>\u003C/div>\u003C/section>\u003Csection id=\"benchmarks\" class=\"lrn-section\" aria-labelledby=\"benchmarks-h\">\u003Ch2 class=\"lrn-h2\" id=\"benchmarks-h\">\u003Cspan class=\"lrn-h2-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">//\u003C/span> Benchmarks\u003C/h2>\u003Col class=\"mdl-chart\" aria-label=\"Benchmark scores\">\u003Cli class=\"mdl-chart-row\">\u003Ca class=\"mdl-chart-name\" href=\"https://www-cdn.anthropic.com/fed9cc193a14b84131812372d8d5857f8f304c52/Model_Card_Claude_3_Addendum.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" title=\"Source: www-cdn.anthropic.com\">GPQA Diamond (0-shot CoT)\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"mdl-chart-track\">\u003Cspan class=\"mdl-chart-fill\" style=\"width:59.4%\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mdl-chart-val\">59.4%\u003C/span>\u003C/li>\u003Cli class=\"mdl-chart-row\">\u003Ca class=\"mdl-chart-name\" href=\"https://www-cdn.anthropic.com/fed9cc193a14b84131812372d8d5857f8f304c52/Model_Card_Claude_3_Addendum.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" title=\"Source: www-cdn.anthropic.com\">MMLU (5-shot)\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"mdl-chart-track\">\u003Cspan class=\"mdl-chart-fill\" style=\"width:88.7%\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mdl-chart-val\">88.7%\u003C/span>\u003C/li>\u003Cli class=\"mdl-chart-row\">\u003Ca class=\"mdl-chart-name\" href=\"https://www-cdn.anthropic.com/fed9cc193a14b84131812372d8d5857f8f304c52/Model_Card_Claude_3_Addendum.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" title=\"Source: www-cdn.anthropic.com\">HumanEval (0-shot)\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"mdl-chart-track\">\u003Cspan class=\"mdl-chart-fill\" style=\"width:92%\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mdl-chart-val\">92%\u003C/span>\u003C/li>\u003Cli class=\"mdl-chart-row\">\u003Ca class=\"mdl-chart-name\" href=\"https://www-cdn.anthropic.com/fed9cc193a14b84131812372d8d5857f8f304c52/Model_Card_Claude_3_Addendum.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" title=\"Source: www-cdn.anthropic.com\">MMMU (vision)\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"mdl-chart-track\">\u003Cspan class=\"mdl-chart-fill\" style=\"width:68.3%\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mdl-chart-val\">68.3%\u003C/span>\u003C/li>\u003C/ol>\u003Cp class=\"mdl-chart-cap\">Scores on a 0–100 scale (25-point gridlines); higher is better. Each benchmark links to its published source.\u003C/p>\u003C/section>\u003Csection id=\"pricing\" class=\"lrn-section\" aria-labelledby=\"pricing-h\">\u003Ch2 class=\"lrn-h2\" id=\"pricing-h\">\u003Cspan class=\"lrn-h2-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">//\u003C/span> Pricing\u003C/h2>\u003Cdiv class=\"lrn-table-wrap\">\u003Ctable class=\"lrn-table\">\u003Ctbody>\u003Ctr>\u003Cth scope=\"row\">Input\u003C/th>\u003Ctd>\u003Cspan class=\"mdl-price-amt\">$3.00\u003C/span> \u003Cspan class=\"mdl-price-unit\">per million tokens\u003C/span>\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Cth scope=\"row\">Output\u003C/th>\u003Ctd>\u003Cspan class=\"mdl-price-amt\">$15.00\u003C/span> \u003Cspan class=\"mdl-price-unit\">per million tokens\u003C/span>\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003C/tbody>\u003C/table>\u003C/div>\u003Cp class=\"lrn-p\">One-fifth the cost of Claude 3 Opus at launch.\u003C/p>\u003Cp class=\"lrn-p\">\u003Ca href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/news/claude-3-5-sonnet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Pricing source ↗\u003C/a>\u003C/p>\u003C/section>\u003Csection id=\"strengths\" class=\"lrn-section\" aria-labelledby=\"strengths-h\">\u003Ch2 class=\"lrn-h2\" id=\"strengths-h\">\u003Cspan class=\"lrn-h2-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">//\u003C/span> Strengths\u003C/h2>\u003Cul class=\"lrn-list\">\u003Cli>Outperformed the larger Claude 3 Opus on most benchmarks at one-fifth the cost\u003C/li>\u003Cli>Strong coding (92.0% HumanEval) and reasoning (59.4% GPQA Diamond)\u003C/li>\u003Cli>Best-in-class vision at launch (68.3% MMMU)\u003C/li>\u003Cli>Introduced Artifacts for interactive, iterative output on claude.ai\u003C/li>\u003Cli>Roughly 2x the speed of Claude 3 Opus\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>\u003C/section>\u003Csection id=\"use-cases\" class=\"lrn-section\" aria-labelledby=\"use-cases-h\">\u003Ch2 class=\"lrn-h2\" id=\"use-cases-h\">\u003Cspan class=\"lrn-h2-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">//\u003C/span> Best for\u003C/h2>\u003Cul class=\"lrn-list\">\u003Cli>General coding and code generation\u003C/li>\u003Cli>Graduate- and undergraduate-level reasoning and knowledge work\u003C/li>\u003Cli>Vision tasks: charts, diagrams and document understanding\u003C/li>\u003Cli>Interactive content generation via Artifacts\u003C/li>\u003Cli>Cost-efficient replacement for larger flagship models\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>\u003C/section>\u003Csection id=\"access\" class=\"lrn-section\" aria-labelledby=\"access-h\">\u003Ch2 class=\"lrn-h2\" id=\"access-h\">\u003Cspan class=\"lrn-h2-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">//\u003C/span> How to access\u003C/h2>\u003Cdiv class=\"lrn-table-wrap\">\u003Ctable class=\"lrn-table\">\u003Cthead>\u003Ctr>\u003Cth>Provider\u003C/th>\u003Cth>Model ID\u003C/th>\u003C/tr>\u003C/thead>\u003Ctbody>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>\u003Ca href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/news/claude-3-5-sonnet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Anthropic ↗\u003C/a>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>\u003Ccode>claude-3-5-sonnet-20240620\u003C/code>\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>\u003Ca href=\"https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/build-with-claude/claude-in-amazon-bedrock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Amazon Bedrock ↗\u003C/a>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>\u003Ccode>anthropic.claude-3-5-sonnet-20240620-v1:0\u003C/code>\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003C/tbody>\u003C/table>\u003C/div>\u003C/section>\u003Csection id=\"history\" class=\"lrn-section\" aria-labelledby=\"history-h\">\u003Ch2 class=\"lrn-h2\" id=\"history-h\">\u003Cspan class=\"lrn-h2-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">//\u003C/span> Claude Sonnet — every version\u003C/h2>\u003Cp class=\"lrn-p\">The full lineage of the Claude Sonnet line, newest first. Every version has its own page — click any to compare specs, benchmarks and pricing.\u003C/p>\u003Cdiv class=\"lrn-table-wrap\">\u003Ctable class=\"lrn-table lrn-cmp\">\u003Cthead>\u003Ctr>\u003Cth>Version\u003C/th>\u003Cth>Released\u003C/th>\u003Cth>Context\u003C/th>\u003Cth>License\u003C/th>\u003C/tr>\u003C/thead>\u003Ctbody>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd class=\"lrn-cmp-name\">\u003Ca href=\"/models/claude-sonnet-5/\" data-internal=\"true\">Claude Sonnet 5\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"mdl-cmp-badge\">current\u003C/span>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>2026-06-30\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>1M\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>Proprietary\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd class=\"lrn-cmp-name\">\u003Ca href=\"/models/claude-sonnet-4-6/\" data-internal=\"true\">Claude Sonnet 4.6\u003C/a>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>2026-02-17\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>1M\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>Proprietary\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd class=\"lrn-cmp-name\">\u003Ca href=\"/models/claude-sonnet-4-5/\" data-internal=\"true\">Claude Sonnet 4.5\u003C/a>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>2025-09-29\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>1M\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>Proprietary\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd class=\"lrn-cmp-name\">\u003Ca href=\"/models/claude-sonnet-4/\" data-internal=\"true\">Claude Sonnet 4\u003C/a>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>2025-05-22\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>200K\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>Proprietary\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd class=\"lrn-cmp-name\">\u003Ca href=\"/models/claude-3-7-sonnet/\" data-internal=\"true\">Claude 3.7 Sonnet\u003C/a>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>2025-02-24\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>200K\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>Proprietary\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd class=\"lrn-cmp-name\">\u003Ca href=\"/models/claude-3-5-sonnet-v2/\" data-internal=\"true\">Claude 3.5 Sonnet (new)\u003C/a>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>2024-10-22\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>200K\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>Proprietary\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr class=\"lrn-cmp-cur\">\u003Ctd class=\"lrn-cmp-name\">\u003Cstrong>Claude 3.5 Sonnet\u003C/strong>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>2024-06-20\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>200K\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>Proprietary\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd class=\"lrn-cmp-name\">\u003Ca href=\"/models/claude-3-sonnet/\" data-internal=\"true\">Claude 3 Sonnet\u003C/a>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>2024-03-04\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>200K\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>Proprietary\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003C/tbody>\u003C/table>\u003C/div>\u003C/section>\u003Csection id=\"faq\" class=\"lrn-section lrn-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-h\">\u003Ch2 class=\"lrn-h2\" id=\"faq-h\">\u003Cspan class=\"lrn-h2-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">//\u003C/span> FAQ\u003C/h2>\u003Cdetails class=\"lrn-faq-item\">\u003Csummary>Why was the original Claude 3.5 Sonnet significant?\u003C/summary>\u003Cp>Released June 20, 2024, it beat the larger Claude 3 Opus on most benchmarks while keeping mid-tier price and faster speed, and it introduced Artifacts on claude.ai.\u003C/p>\u003C/details>\u003Cdetails class=\"lrn-faq-item\">\u003Csummary>What were its benchmark scores?\u003C/summary>\u003Cp>59.4% on GPQA Diamond, 88.7% on MMLU, 92.0% on HumanEval, and 68.3% on MMMU for vision.\u003C/p>\u003C/details>\u003Cdetails class=\"lrn-faq-item\">\u003Csummary>What is the model ID and context window?\u003C/summary>\u003Cp>The model ID is claude-3-5-sonnet-20240620, with a 200K token context window and up to 8,192 output tokens.\u003C/p>\u003C/details>\u003Cdetails class=\"lrn-faq-item\">\u003Csummary>Is it still available?\u003C/summary>\u003Cp>No. The June 2024 snapshot was retired on October 28, 2025. Anthropic recommends Claude Sonnet 4.6.\u003C/p>\u003C/details>\u003C/section>"],"uses":{"params":["slug"]}}]}
